    "summary": "During [Declare Battle Formations](vsdata:core-rule/chapter-approved.declare-battle-formations), you can pick **LEGIONARIES** and **CULTIST MOB** units of yours, by [battle size](vsdata:core-rule/select-battle-size): up to 2 of each in Incursion, 3 of each in Strike Force or 4 of each in Onslaught. The picked units, along with each **CHARACTER** unit attached to one of them, except **EPIC HEROES**, get [Infiltrators](vsdata:core-ability/infiltrators) for the rest of the battle.",
